:null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7 rc2\n- Not reproducible in 4.7 rc1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.rc2 - CachyOS Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Fri, 05 Jun 2026 09:37:35 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050 Laptop GPU - AMD Ryzen 9 270 w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads) - 14.90 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Surround 7.1)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen opening the project with a scene open with a certain combination of factors causes a spam of errors:\n\n```\nGodot Engine v4.7.rc2.official (c) 2007-present Juan Linietsky, Ariel Manzur & Godot Contributors.\n  ERROR: Cannot get path of node as it is not in a scene tree.\n(... A lot more of the same error)\n  ERROR: Node not found: \"\" (relative to \"/root/@EditorNode@19513/@Panel@14/@VBoxContainer@15/DockVSplitMain/DockHSplitMain/DockVSplitLeftR/DockSlotLeftUR/Scene/@VBoxContainer@5277/@MarginContainer@5330/@SceneTreeEditor@5374\").\n(... A lot more of the same error)\n```\n\nI don't know what exactly is the combination of factors. It happens in my regular project every time when I open my game level, I tried a lot of different projects that are freely available and didn't trigger the error. I managed to create an MRP.\n\nMy best guess is that it involves both a certain depth of hierarchy in the scene tree (possibly with nested scenes? Not sure) and DEFINITELY fonts set in a richtext label theme overrides (Removing the fonts being set there makes the problem disappear).\n\nIt doesn't happen in 4.7 RC1, happens in 4.7 RC2\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the MRP on 4.7 Rc2\n- If the scene is not open, open the scene main_node.tscn\n- Reload the project so the scene is open already when the project opens\n- Notice the spam of errors.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP_SpamError_47rc2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28860202/MRP_SpamError_47rc2.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120223/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120223/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}